      "narration": "One saddle, two bends. Slice through the origin along the x axis, keeping y at zero: an upward-opening parabola. Slice along the perpendicular y axis, keeping x at zero: a downward-opening parabola. Watch the points move away from the origin along the positive axes, and compare their tangent lines. On the blue section, height rises and slope becomes positive. On the gold section, height falls and slope becomes negative. Both slopes start at zero. The direction of the slice determines which bend you see.",
